WEBVTT

00:10.927 --> 00:12.595
BASED ON THE KINGDOM OF THE GODS BY YLAB

00:12.679 --> 00:14.681
[opening theme music]

01:10.945 --> 01:12.155
[snarls]

01:34.677 --> 01:39.891
THE FIVE ARMIES' BASE CAMP
IN MUNGYEONG SAEJAE

01:45.605 --> 01:47.607
[sinister music]

01:50.944 --> 01:52.362
[sighs]

01:53.029 --> 01:55.240
- [footsteps approaching]
- [muffled snarling]

02:35.488 --> 02:37.448
[tense music]

03:48.269 --> 03:51.522
[nervous breathing]

04:37.652 --> 04:38.945
Something's off, sir.

04:39.696 --> 04:41.114
They have very few men.

04:41.614 --> 04:42.907
We should move carefully.

04:45.118 --> 04:48.079
[tense music]

04:48.162 --> 04:50.248
[yelling]

05:00.466 --> 05:02.677
[suspenseful music]

05:45.636 --> 05:47.680
[ominous music]

06:07.116 --> 06:08.993
- [rapid footsteps approaching]
- [snarling]

06:09.077 --> 06:10.078
[gasps]

06:10.745 --> 06:13.539
[snarls, screeches]

06:35.937 --> 06:36.938
[gasps]

06:37.021 --> 06:38.439
[drumbeat continuing]

06:46.364 --> 06:47.448
[gasps in fright]

07:06.801 --> 07:07.969
What did you...

07:09.637 --> 07:11.097
Where is His Royal Highness?

07:11.180 --> 07:15.226
He is undeserving of that title.
He is a traitor.

07:15.309 --> 07:17.687
You are the one
that is betraying our nation,

07:18.146 --> 07:19.313
not His Highness!

07:19.397 --> 07:21.190
You are not the judge of that.

07:22.400 --> 07:24.735
His Majesty will decide who is guilty.

07:27.029 --> 07:29.782
It is through the kindness of His Majesty
he has come,

07:31.325 --> 07:34.620
so that he could issue
this traitor's punishment in person.

07:39.500 --> 07:41.294
[snarls]

07:47.008 --> 07:48.384
Step aside.

07:48.926 --> 07:52.138
Those standing in my way now
will never find forgiveness.

07:54.432 --> 07:55.933
It was only three years ago

07:56.017 --> 07:58.352
that you saved countless lives
in Gyeongsang

07:58.436 --> 07:59.896
from certain destruction.

08:00.229 --> 08:03.483
You are a man of remarkable wisdom
and bravery,

08:04.275 --> 08:06.819
so why have you sided with this traitor?

08:07.236 --> 08:09.864
I understand it is difficult
to desert someone

08:09.947 --> 08:11.157
who was once your disciple.

08:13.409 --> 08:16.037
However, if you acknowledge
your grave mistake...

08:17.163 --> 08:19.540
your life might possibly be spared.

08:32.553 --> 08:34.472
[snarls]

08:36.599 --> 08:38.518
Father! Father!

08:54.242 --> 08:57.703
[low growling]

09:08.965 --> 09:09.966
[gasps]

09:14.637 --> 09:16.931
[King] Everyone I have ever loved has died

09:17.265 --> 09:19.100
or was denied their birthright.

09:20.059 --> 09:21.644
You are my only son...

09:22.311 --> 09:24.855
the importance of your life
affects me greatly.

09:26.983 --> 09:29.902
No matter what happens, you must survive.

09:30.486 --> 09:33.281
Your survival proves
that you are different from them...

09:33.864 --> 09:35.366
and that you are different from me.

09:36.242 --> 09:37.410
Prove it to them.

09:37.868 --> 09:40.663
Show them what a true king ought to be.

09:44.458 --> 09:45.876
I'm here, Father.

09:48.087 --> 09:49.714
It's me, your son, Chang.

09:52.842 --> 09:54.719
[snarls]

09:55.553 --> 09:56.554
[sighs]

10:01.517 --> 10:03.227
I'm ending this madness.

10:04.061 --> 10:07.189
I have lived in hell
for the last three years because of you.

10:07.690 --> 10:11.736
You won't deceive me this time around,
not like you did then.

10:14.405 --> 10:15.948
His Majesty...

10:17.658 --> 10:19.118
His Majesty is dead!

10:20.453 --> 10:23.372
Blinded by his endless lust for power,

10:24.624 --> 10:26.834
Cho Hak-ju resurrected the King.

10:29.128 --> 10:32.340
He has transformed him into a monster
that hungers for flesh.

10:33.341 --> 10:35.551
Since His Majesty is no longer with us,

10:36.677 --> 10:37.928
the throne should...

10:39.388 --> 10:41.015
then be passed down the line...

10:41.849 --> 10:43.434
in accordance with the law.

10:45.227 --> 10:47.480
[ominous music]

10:54.528 --> 10:55.988
Why do you hesitate?

10:56.322 --> 10:57.323
Shoot him.

11:09.960 --> 11:12.421
You will shoot him, or you will be next.

11:12.505 --> 11:13.422
[gasps]

11:22.431 --> 11:23.432
[gasps]

11:28.562 --> 11:30.856
[groans, wheezes]

11:37.905 --> 11:39.532
Shoot him down!

11:56.632 --> 11:58.634
[dramatic music]

12:26.036 --> 12:26.912
[pained grunt]

12:28.205 --> 12:31.500
[groans]

12:34.378 --> 12:36.297
[menacing music]

12:50.603 --> 12:52.521
[breathing shakily]

12:54.148 --> 12:56.650
[pants]

13:00.029 --> 13:01.030
[sighs in anger]

13:06.494 --> 13:07.953
[groaning]

13:09.121 --> 13:10.873
[pants]

13:11.582 --> 13:12.875
I...

13:15.377 --> 13:16.879
I beheaded...

13:19.548 --> 13:22.134
I beheaded my father. He's dead.

13:24.303 --> 13:26.430
Your Highness...
[breathing heavily]

13:28.182 --> 13:31.393
none of this is your fault.
[groaning]

13:33.854 --> 13:35.105
Listen to me.

13:36.106 --> 13:37.858
[wheezes]
You are now...

13:40.152 --> 13:43.739
You are the rightful king.

13:55.709 --> 13:58.087
[ominous music]

14:21.569 --> 14:23.946
Not the King!

15:02.443 --> 15:03.819
The Five Armies...

15:05.487 --> 15:08.407
shall arrest the traitor
and all his allies...

15:09.700 --> 15:12.828
who beheaded His Majesty!

15:29.219 --> 15:32.932
HANYANG

15:34.642 --> 15:39.021
ROYAL COMMANDERY DIVISION

15:43.192 --> 15:44.401
Good sir...

15:44.693 --> 15:47.321
do you intend to search
the Queen's private residence?

15:47.613 --> 15:49.073
There are trails of blood from the creek

15:49.156 --> 15:51.241
surrounding
where that dead woman was found.

15:51.325 --> 15:53.619
That trail leads all the way back
to Naeseonjae.

15:54.078 --> 15:57.206
I am nearly certain that
she made her escape from this area.

15:57.998 --> 16:00.501
She claimed that there were more women
held captive here.

16:01.126 --> 16:03.545
- Investigation is imperative.
- I see.

16:04.213 --> 16:06.799
The Haewon Cho Clan
must be connected to this.

16:07.800 --> 16:09.718
Would you speak truth to such power?

16:11.387 --> 16:12.388
[sighs]

16:14.139 --> 16:16.642
I have given much thought
to the consequences.

16:18.268 --> 16:21.355
The Haewon Cho Clan's power
is without equal in this country.

16:22.356 --> 16:24.316
However, if this crime took place here,

16:24.400 --> 16:26.694
we will investigate
in the name of our people.

16:27.903 --> 16:29.738
We must learn what happened.

16:34.326 --> 16:38.622
My Lady, the Royal Commandery Division
are investigating Naeseonjae.

16:38.706 --> 16:40.708
[woman breathing anxiously]

16:41.792 --> 16:44.253
NAESEONJAE

16:52.678 --> 16:53.971
We must hurry.

17:01.186 --> 17:03.897
[groaning, snarling]

17:05.482 --> 17:08.902
[snarling]

17:08.986 --> 17:10.195
[man 1 chuckles]

17:10.946 --> 17:12.614
- [man 1 gasps]
- [retches]

17:12.698 --> 17:14.950
- Come on, what are you doing?
- [coughing]

17:15.034 --> 17:16.785
- Go on, get off!
- [groans]

17:16.869 --> 17:19.663
Why are you puking everywhere, you drunk?

17:19.747 --> 17:22.249
I can't believe you threw up
that expensive wine!

17:22.374 --> 17:23.250
Yah!

17:29.631 --> 17:32.801
[woman] Officer, for what reason
must you visit this late in the evening?

17:33.844 --> 17:36.472
We received a report of a murder
at this location.

17:36.555 --> 17:39.141
We are conducting a search,
and you will cooperate.

17:40.059 --> 17:42.061
- Everyone, scatter and search!
- [soldiers] Yes, sir!

17:42.144 --> 17:44.855
Officer, this is a private residence
of Her Majesty.

17:45.647 --> 17:47.775
It is unlikely that anyone here
will behave

17:47.858 --> 17:49.902
in an unbecoming manner to her reputation.

17:50.319 --> 17:53.238
The incident you are describing
could not have happened here.

17:53.322 --> 17:54.573
[soldier 1] Search the quarters!

18:16.345 --> 18:18.055
Who lives in that house?

18:18.138 --> 18:20.724
Normally, it is where
we would accommodate guests.

18:20.808 --> 18:21.975
For now, it's empty.

18:43.872 --> 18:45.040
[sighs]

19:01.306 --> 19:02.933
[breathing anxiously]

19:03.016 --> 19:04.184
[soldier 2, outside] Sir,

19:04.268 --> 19:06.186
there's something
you need to see over here!

19:10.357 --> 19:11.316
[woman exhales]

19:14.027 --> 19:15.112
Over here, sir.

19:17.823 --> 19:19.533
Winter has frozen most of the soil,

19:19.616 --> 19:21.326
but this spot here is soft.

19:22.327 --> 19:24.454
It looks like someone buried something.

19:32.588 --> 19:33.463
Yah!

19:42.222 --> 19:43.640
[horses galloping]

19:45.726 --> 19:47.436
This way. Come on, let's go.

19:48.395 --> 19:50.731
[panicked chatter]

19:59.031 --> 20:01.575
That group over there.
Don't let them get away!

20:04.828 --> 20:06.914
[panicked yelling]

20:14.213 --> 20:15.547
[soldier 1] What are you doing?

20:17.549 --> 20:20.761
- [soldier 2] Over here!
- [panicked yelling]

20:30.229 --> 20:32.522
[ominous music]

20:36.276 --> 20:37.277
How mortifying.

20:38.028 --> 20:39.947
They were all found at Naeseonjae?

20:40.405 --> 20:41.406
[commander] Yes, sir.

20:41.865 --> 20:44.826
We found the corpses
of seven pregnant women and infants.

20:46.203 --> 20:49.665
The women we found were stabbed,
but something was odd about the children.

20:50.332 --> 20:52.876
All the female infants
were strangled to death,

20:52.960 --> 20:55.337
but it doesn't seem
like anything was done to the boy.

20:57.130 --> 20:59.841
I believe that one
must have been stillborn.

20:59.925 --> 21:00.801
But how...

21:01.885 --> 21:03.553
How could this happen?

21:06.223 --> 21:08.183
Something very strange is going on.

21:09.351 --> 21:11.728
Why do you think
that the girls were murdered...

21:12.521 --> 21:14.731
and that only the boy remains untouched?

21:15.440 --> 21:18.777
Good sir, what are you trying to say?

21:20.904 --> 21:24.533
Whoever it is that took the lives
that once belonged to these bodies...

21:26.034 --> 21:28.287
they were looking for a son
among these women.

21:30.664 --> 21:31.832
[sighs]

21:31.915 --> 21:33.583
[horn blares]

21:33.667 --> 21:34.501
[gasps]

21:37.462 --> 21:38.463
[sighs]

21:39.464 --> 21:41.550
Uh, isn't that the horn?

21:44.511 --> 21:47.556
The one that tells us
that the King has passed away.

21:48.223 --> 21:50.475
[foreboding music]

21:52.811 --> 21:55.105
[horn blaring]

21:57.607 --> 21:59.943
Tell me, what on earth happened?

22:03.071 --> 22:06.074
This is a letter that was sent
from the Chief State Councilor.

22:06.158 --> 22:07.451
He's in Joryeong.

22:11.079 --> 22:13.957
[Cho Hak-ju] The plague in Gyeongsang
is out of control

22:14.041 --> 22:16.626
and Crown Prince Chang
has committed high treason.

22:17.252 --> 22:21.006
Despite battling illness,
His Majesty came all the way to Joryeong.

22:21.715 --> 22:24.051
We were victorious
in containing the plague

22:24.134 --> 22:25.344
in Mungyeong Saejae,

22:25.427 --> 22:28.221
but Chang and his aides
took advantage of the chaos

22:28.305 --> 22:29.514
to seize the throne.

22:29.973 --> 22:32.642
It was then
that Chang decapitated His Majesty

22:32.726 --> 22:34.144
with his own hands.

22:34.811 --> 22:38.398
- [men] Your Majesty!
- [man 1] Your Majesty!

22:38.482 --> 22:41.526
- [sobbing]
- Your Majesty!

22:41.610 --> 22:43.779
[man 2] Return to us!

22:44.237 --> 22:46.615
Return to us!

22:51.370 --> 22:54.414
[sobbing]

23:40.877 --> 23:42.879
[guard 1] What should be done
with the Lord's corpse?

23:48.051 --> 23:51.680
Though he sided with the traitor,
he was still a hero to all of us.

23:53.598 --> 23:56.017
You should dress him in shrouds
and lay him to rest.

23:56.435 --> 23:57.394
Sir.

23:59.729 --> 24:01.106
Taxation and rites...

24:01.189 --> 24:02.315
HANYANG CONFERENCE HALL

24:02.399 --> 24:04.025
you will handle the state funeral.

24:04.109 --> 24:06.903
The Chief Magistrate
of the Capital District Office

24:06.987 --> 24:09.656
should secure and repair any damage

24:09.739 --> 24:12.075
to bridges and pathways
along the burial route.

24:12.868 --> 24:15.662
Are there not more pressing matters
to attend to?

24:16.955 --> 24:18.623
Our throne is currently vacant.

24:18.707 --> 24:20.917
Finding an heir quickly
should be our first priority.

24:21.001 --> 24:24.379
Well, at the moment, we do have
the Queen standing in as our regent.

24:25.213 --> 24:27.924
She should give birth
to a potential heir any day now.

24:29.050 --> 24:31.303
That child has every chance
of being a boy,

24:31.386 --> 24:33.555
which would then mean
he would inherit the throne.

24:33.638 --> 24:35.390
And what if it's not a boy?

24:36.475 --> 24:39.936
We must search the collateral bloodlines
to be prepared.

24:41.104 --> 24:44.816
There are children of Prince Noseong.
I believe he was executed in Ganghwa.

24:44.900 --> 24:49.112
Those children are hardly related to him.
Why must we go that far down the line?

24:49.196 --> 24:51.156
Or do you just want to put a puppet
on the throne?

24:51.239 --> 24:53.116
The Second State Councilor is right.

24:53.200 --> 24:55.911
We must take great care to follow the rule
of primogeniture.

24:55.994 --> 24:59.247
We will table this discussion
until the birth of the child.

24:59.331 --> 25:01.625
[guard] Honorable gentlemen,
this is the head eunuch.

25:03.502 --> 25:06.463
I've received a message
from the Office of Royal Delivery.

25:07.380 --> 25:09.341
Her Majesty has begun labor.

25:09.424 --> 25:11.635
The Queens's baby should arrive
imminently.

25:13.094 --> 25:15.722
Certainly, that is well-timed.

25:15.805 --> 25:18.099
Ha, some good news
makes for a nice change.

25:18.683 --> 25:20.393
I suppose all we can do for now

25:20.477 --> 25:22.854
is wait to see
if Her Majesty gives us a prince.

25:22.938 --> 25:24.439
- [councilor 2] Certainly.
- [chuckling]

25:24.523 --> 25:27.150
DELIVERY ROOM AT THE QUEEN'S PALACE

25:29.319 --> 25:30.570
This is the Queen's room.

25:31.404 --> 25:33.949
Her Majesty has been waiting for you
and the nurse.

25:37.953 --> 25:39.204
Let us proceed.

25:48.255 --> 25:51.174
Your Majesty, this is the head court lady.

26:04.521 --> 26:07.315
The royal physician is here for you.

26:18.577 --> 26:20.829
What did you do
with the rest of the girls?

26:21.162 --> 26:24.249
They were taken care of,
as per Your Majesty's orders.

26:25.792 --> 26:28.211
[ominous music]

26:34.092 --> 26:36.970
You want me to keep pushing
the Naeseonjae investigation?

26:37.053 --> 26:38.430
That is correct.

26:38.888 --> 26:41.558
But you must do so in complete secrecy.

26:41.641 --> 26:42.892
Understood, sir.

26:43.226 --> 26:44.436
We do not have much time.

26:44.519 --> 26:46.688
We must find out the truth

26:47.314 --> 26:49.941
before the Queen births that child.

26:52.986 --> 26:55.488
THE BASE CAMP IN MUNGYEONG SAEJAE

26:57.365 --> 26:58.283
State your business.

26:58.366 --> 27:00.869
The magistrate told me to stop by,

27:00.952 --> 27:03.163
and to perform a wellness check
on the Prince.

27:03.246 --> 27:04.956
This order came directly
from the magistrate?

27:06.082 --> 27:06.916
Yes.

27:08.793 --> 27:10.587
CHO BEOM-PAL

27:42.077 --> 27:43.328
Highness.

27:44.496 --> 27:46.081
How have you been feeling?

27:49.584 --> 27:52.545
Hanyang is far,
and the journey won't be easy.

27:53.380 --> 27:56.633
I'll treat your wound first
so you can keep it from getting infected.

28:09.646 --> 28:11.106
[exhales]

28:30.208 --> 28:32.502
[tense music]

28:34.087 --> 28:35.380
[breathing anxiously]

28:37.882 --> 28:40.051
[man] There's no way they didn't know
we were coming.

28:40.677 --> 28:43.012
We were set up. Someone told them.

28:44.806 --> 28:45.890
That must mean...

28:47.225 --> 28:48.768
there is a spy among us.

28:51.187 --> 28:53.231
We shouldn't be talking
to each other right now.

28:56.109 --> 28:57.152
What does that mean?

28:57.235 --> 28:59.946
I'm not going to die in this prison. No.

29:01.781 --> 29:04.743
My purpose won't be complete
until I avenge my family.

29:06.786 --> 29:09.122
They will pay for Lord Ahn Hyeon's death.
Will you help me?

29:09.748 --> 29:12.208
I swear I will do everything
in my power

29:12.292 --> 29:13.793
to make them pay for it.

29:14.836 --> 29:16.463
But is there any way for us to do that?

29:18.173 --> 29:19.716
Our lives are already forfeit.

29:22.635 --> 29:24.971
Might as well
take Cho Hak-ju down with us.

29:28.558 --> 29:30.059
Just before we leave for Hanyang...

29:31.019 --> 29:32.520
that is our only opportunity.

29:44.282 --> 29:45.325
[exhales sharply]

30:14.521 --> 30:17.315
What's the matter?
Is there something I should know?

30:20.652 --> 30:22.612
Work is completed.
We're ready to leave, sir.

30:25.114 --> 30:27.534
I see. Gather the traitors.

30:27.617 --> 30:29.035
[door opens]

30:34.958 --> 30:36.251
[door opens]

30:48.304 --> 30:49.472
[guard] On your feet!

31:16.499 --> 31:18.167
[tense music]

31:24.591 --> 31:26.342
[men grunting aggressively]

31:45.361 --> 31:47.071
They are begging to be killed.

31:47.155 --> 31:48.948
Spare the Crown Prince's life.

31:49.741 --> 31:51.701
You can do what you will with the rest.

31:56.331 --> 31:57.332
Cover me!

32:08.426 --> 32:09.719
[tense music]

32:11.888 --> 32:13.181
[gunshot echoes]

32:16.851 --> 32:18.394
[both gasp]

32:36.412 --> 32:38.331
Someone arrest that man at once!

32:48.925 --> 32:51.135
[foreboding music]

32:56.474 --> 32:58.059
[both breathing anxiously]

33:01.688 --> 33:04.899
[men screaming]

33:07.235 --> 33:10.071
- [distant snarling]
- [men screaming]

33:11.531 --> 33:13.157
[soldier] He's coming! He's coming!

33:16.035 --> 33:19.539
[low growling]

33:26.504 --> 33:27.964
[suspenseful music]

33:31.050 --> 33:32.135
[snarls]

33:40.101 --> 33:41.394
[soldiers whimpering]

33:56.743 --> 34:00.705
[snarling]

34:13.426 --> 34:14.635
Shoot him in the head.

34:15.762 --> 34:17.138
Put an arrow in his head!

34:33.696 --> 34:37.450
[groans]
Your Highness, listen to me...

34:38.743 --> 34:41.079
there is only one way to survive.

34:41.537 --> 34:42.789
When I leave you,

34:43.706 --> 34:46.501
take my body and turn me...

34:47.502 --> 34:49.504
into a monster.

34:52.465 --> 34:54.675
I need you to do this.

34:55.384 --> 34:58.513
It's the only way to reveal the truth.

34:59.639 --> 35:00.556
[snarls]

35:00.640 --> 35:01.891
[panicked shouting]

35:07.688 --> 35:08.731
[gasps]

35:31.462 --> 35:33.464
[closing theme music]
